# AstraeaOS WP ships byte-exact SHA-256 manifests (BUILD-MANIFEST.json,
# astraea-core/BUILD-MANIFEST.json). Any end-of-line conversion or encoding
# rewriting by Git would invalidate those hashes, so EOL transformation is
# disabled for the whole tree.
* -text

# Explicit binary declarations (also prevents diff noise)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.mo binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
